@0 = ~Sorcerer/Monk multiclass for GemRB~
@1 = ~sorcerer/monk~
@2 = ~SORCERER/MONK:

A lawful multiclass combining spontaneous arcane spellcasting with a monk's unarmed combat, movement, defenses and class abilities.

The class uses split multiclass progression, Sorcerer spell selection, Monk fists and Monk class abilities. It is restricted to humans and lawful alignments. Item restrictions from both Sorcerer/Mage and Monk are applied.

Dual-classing is not supported.~
@3 = ~Sorcerer/Monk~
@4 = ~Run this game with GemRB at least once before installing. WeiDU could not find gemrb_path.txt.~
@5 = ~This mod supports Tutu, Tutu_TotSC, BGEE, Classic Adventures, BG2, ToB, BGT, BG2EE and EET installations running through GemRB.~
@7 = ~No compatible GemRB class slot is available. Playable class IDs must match CLSKILLS.2DA row indices and remain below 32.~
@8 = ~A lawful spontaneous arcane caster trained in unarmed combat and monastic disciplines.~
@9 = ~Could not determine the existing numeric class identifiers from the GemRB class tables.~
@10 = ~Unsupported CLSKILLS.2DA layout. Expected the released or development GemRB format.~
@12 = ~Unsupported CLASSTEXT.2DA layout. Expected the normalized GemRB or native Enhanced Edition format.~
@13 = ~The GemRB class tables and CLSKILLS.2DA disagree about the numeric class identifier required for Sorcerer/Monk. Remove or reorder conflicting custom-class mods before installing.~
@14 = ~Could not determine a valid Sorcerer/Monk experience cap from XPCAP.2DA.~
@15 = ~Unsupported CLASSES.2DA layout. Expected the released combined or current split GemRB format.~
@16 = ~Sorcerer/Monk cannot be installed while Sorcerer/Monk/Cleric is installed. The two legacy mods share a WeiDU backup namespace and can corrupt each other's uninstall state. Uninstall Sorcerer/Monk/Cleric first.~
